[ti:Twinkle Twinkle Little Star]
[ar:Traditional]
[al:Nursery Rhymes]

[00:00.029]Twinkle, twinkle, little star
[00:00.033:zh]一闪一闪亮晶晶
[00:04.035]How I wonder what you are
[00:04.037:zh]满天都是小星星
[00:08.039]Up above the world so high
[00:08.043:zh]挂在天上放光明
[00:12.045]Like a diamond in the sky
[00:12.047:zh]好像许多小眼睛
[00:16.049]Twinkle, twinkle, little star
[00:16.055:zh]一闪一闪亮晶晶
[00:20.057]How I wonder what you are
[00:20.059:zh]满天都是小星星